-- section 4.13 defer: DEFER-01 general accept (check-only positive)
-- @req: DEFER-01
-- @expected-pass-after: phase-32
-- A general `defer <statement>` (here: `defer print(x)`) must be accepted by
-- the analyzer once the Phase-21 `defer free`-only gate (E0276) is removed.
-- RED now: `ironc check` still emits E0276 (IRON_ERR_DEFER_FORM_UNSUPPORTED).
-- The CTest asserts E0276 is ABSENT via whole-pipeline negation; flips GREEN in
-- Plan 32-02. The deferred statement runs at the normal fall-through exit edge,
-- so intended stdout is `body` then `1`.

func main() {
    var x = 1
    defer print(x)
    print("body")
}
